<li class=3D"checked" data-inline-task-id=3D"10"><span class=3D"placeholder=
-inline-tasks">check bundle id is <code>com.shoalter.ios.merchant.threepl</=
code></span></li>
<li class=3D"checked" data-inline-task-id=3D"4"><span class=3D"placeholder-=
inline-tasks">Make sure Archive Build Configuration is Release</span></li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"5"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Star=
t Archive: (TODO: use script to +1, then start to archive by script)</span>=
</li>
<li data-inline-task-id=3D"28"><span class=3D"placeholder-inline-tasks">Che=
ck is newest correct version, scroll to top, check timestamp be the latest =
one</span></li>
</ul>
